<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on itself.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on itself.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued a total of 20 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on registered shares of itself, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    10.MAR.97		 MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     SPOT REF     280 CHF * *</p>
<p>* *  WARRANT   STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING     MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    300 CHF   2.82 CHF  17.21 PCT  9.93 TIMES  03.APR.00</p>
<p> CALL B    300 CHF   3.28 CHF  18.86 PCT  8.53 TIMES  02.APR.01</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
